AO6SJc7FbyFj","user":{"login":"andrea-calligaris","id":10872697,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODcyNjk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10872697?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris","html_url":"https://github.com/andrea-calligaris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrea-calligaris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T14:21:04Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T14:22:57Z","body":"> Can you reproduce this with game window embedding disabled?\n\n(Ah, I was wondering how does one turn off that new debugging toolbar...)\n\nIt does improve the performance, albeit still not as smooth as on Windows, and you can still see the black artifacts.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4657c678-0390-4429-8a3e-db70b2e5802d","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3312394595/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3319677377","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110689#issuecomment-3319677377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110689","id":3319677377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7F3kHB","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T15:16:53Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T15:18:44Z","body":"This is not really something that's fixable, as resizing a swapchain on Vulkan is a slow operation. The issue should be less noticeable in Compatibility (OpenGL) where recreating its equivalent of a swapchain is significantly faster (also because it's a simpler renderer).\n\nThe issue is present on all platforms, but it tends to be worse on Linux under X11. Having compositing disabled can also exacerbate the issue.\n\nIt *might* be possible to use a different color instead of black during the resize operation. We could use the default clear color for this, so it looks seamless in a new project. However, this is nontrivial to figure out.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3319677377/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null